  (text "Keep-alive: KA square wave (about 10 kHz) charges KY; Q holds OE_N low (outputs on). KA stops -> OE_N pulled high -> all outputs off in about 1 ms." (at 140 172 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid fe8fd318-33a1-4c78-b5ae-98d561e2c0f7))
  (text "KA must be toggled by firmware (once per scheduler frame), NOT by a free-running timer: a timer keeps toggling through a hang or a debugger halt." (at 140 180 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid affbe596-8429-4b2c-a0cb-308ca3517e52))
  (text "JP bypasses the keep-alive for debugging only. Leave open in normal use." (at 140 176 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 5e58b353-2f00-4ebf-894b-99d5ae724c69))
  (text "Chain: SER -> U_A -> U_B -> U_C. QA..QH of U_A drive G_A1..G_A8 (limbs L1, L2), U_B -> L3, L4, U_C -> L5, L6." (at 40 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid ddf02d52-116d-440e-8355-c0ac5f4ac3a9))
